{
  "title": "Kitchen Style Algerian Gobo Burdock Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and earthy stew featuring gobo burdock, lardons, and ayurvedic tamasic friendly ingredients, perfect for a family dinner",
  "cuisine": "Algerian",
